{"about_the_game":"Quadrium 3 is a new marble match game. The aim of the game is to clear the playing field by shooting the marbles from the edges and forming groups of two to remove them from the playing field. Various obstacles such as crates, glass, fog, deflecting arrows, static tiles and portals add variety to the gameplay. Juicy and smooth graphics, relaxing music and no time limit allow you to enjoy the innovative gameplay to the fullest! Relax and have fun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n* 135 challenging levels<br />\r\n* Lots of bonus tiles<br />\r\n* Beautiful artwork, colorful tiles and bonuses<br />\r\n* Relaxing music<br />\r\n* No time limits","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2800440?t=1708165231","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2800440?t=1708165231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1708165231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1708165231","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Quadrium 3 is a new marble match game. The aim of the game is to clear the playing field by shooting the marbles from the edges and forming groups of two to remove them from the playing field. Various obstacles such as crates, glass, fog, deflecting arrows, static tiles and portals add variety to the gameplay. Juicy and smooth graphics, relaxing music and no time limit allow you to enjoy the innovative gameplay to the fullest! Relax and have fun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n* 135 challenging levels<br />\r\n* Lots of bonus tiles<br />\r\n* Beautiful artwork, colorful tiles and bonuses<br />\r\n* Relaxing music<br />\r\n* No time limits","developers":["IP Izmailov Vladimir Yuriev